<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>HOW WAS YOUR DAY?</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HOW WAS YOUR DAY?</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7uUB3Ypgg4XRD1TIhGqsUE</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000">Hello, I've been on my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.145" end="00:22.676">Trying to find my way back home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.676" end="00:30.676">Trying to find my way back to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.971" end="00:39.971">Hello, we've gotten pretty old</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.521" end="00:53.521">I'm missing all the times that we met</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.550" end="01:01.076">I'm missing all of us, once again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.076" end="01:06.347">So how was your day without me love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.347" end="01:08.923">You moving on?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.923" end="01:16.923">Well I find it okay without your love but feeling strange</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.951" end="01:24.951">'Cause lately I've been second guessing every little moment (Ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.815" end="01:36.078">So how did I do?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.078" end="01:40.129">Can we call it a truce?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.129" end="01:47.411">Are you waiting for me yet again at the end to make amends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.411" end="01:54.437">I'd do it again, through everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.437" end="02:02.152">If we could bring back time again to love again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.152" end="02:07.674">So how was your day without me love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.674" end="02:09.983">You moving on?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.983" end="02:17.761">Well I find it okay without your love but feeling strange</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.761" end="02:21.761">'Cause lately I've been second guessing every little moment (Ah)</p></div></body></tt>